{"root":{"data":{"id":"dli96v9ajfc0","created":1789715484627,"text":"Bootloader"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dli96yl5ffs0","created":1789715491874,"text":"核心职责"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dli978fr7m00","created":1789715513316,"text":"1、判断是否需要升级固件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dli97f68n880","created":1789715527978,"text":"2、如果需要：下载固件、验证完整性、写入Flash、重启进入新固件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dli97rkzu7s0","created":1789715554991,"text":"3、如果不需要：直接跳转到应用程序执行"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dli98eletyg0","created":1789715605082,"text":"Flash分区设计"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dli98n2q16o0","created":1789715623543,"text":"最基础方案：双分区方案"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dli99v517rs0","created":1789715719462,"text":"Bootloader区：存放Bootloader本身，上电后第一个执行，通常做写保护防止意外擦除"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dli99ywzz6o0","created":1789715727683,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}